{"title":"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/b/2eb19736465045fc5d42835859779a5de0a91688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\texttt{a}$\" width=\"9\" height=\"7\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/747af5984b877a820a44e84651fb1bdd22b00653.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\texttt{b}$\" width=\"8\" height=\"10\" /> are digits for which\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9dacbce9891c9c31e6664647acc4110be690add9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{array}{ccc}&amp; 2 &amp; a\\\\ \\times &amp; b &amp; 3\\\\ \\hline &amp; 6 &amp; 9\\\\ 9 &amp; 2\\\\ \\hline 9 &amp; 8 &amp; 9\\end{array}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -40px\" width=\"83\" height=\"93\" />\n</p><p>then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/1/3d1a4c72f59af10705739408e8690d45223a8c0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\texttt{a+b =}$\" width=\"43\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70c9abe5a1bb488249d3ffade3fce2284ad22456.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 7 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 9 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the units digit calculation, we see that the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/6/306e89e5f67acc9649774b48f981acd1f5553fdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\times 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/3/4d386bc6b0cfa5c82fea46329236c10def6e38c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le a \\le 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, the only value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> that works is is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.  As a double-check, that does work, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/0/da0d38b997907b55699e5680da99477520d0d3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23 \\times 3 = 69$\" width=\"91\" height=\"12\" />, which is the first line of the multiplication.\n</p><p>The second line of the multiplication can be found by doing the multiplication <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70bd1514a1d35a7b6875951a14d4eb1c7e840fd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23\\times b = 92$\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" />.  Dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a1b2497e7b125cd721bab4c6e2385f954fe35cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c79950dd1b56b3ee64162b9340358301cc3da79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 3 + 4 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"137\" height=\"14\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME\" title=\"1997 AHSME\">1997 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1997 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1997\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1997 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b